    11	 *   - persists, same severity  -> refresh detail silently; re-notify once per cooldown
    12	 *   - gone, node read OK       -> RESOLVED + "cleared" notify
    13	 *   - node not read this sweep -> left untouched (absent evidence is not recovery)
    14	 * Pure planning in `planFleetAlerts` (tested); `applyFleetAlerts` does the I/O.
